<!--
  SITEMAP — HOW TO UPDATE
  ════════════════════════
  When you add a new post:
    1. Add a new <url> block below (copy an existing one)
    2. Update <loc> with the full URL to the new post
    3. Update <lastmod> with today's date (YYYY-MM-DD format)
    4. <changefreq> for posts: "monthly" or "yearly"
    5. <priority>: 0.8 for posts, 1.0 for homepage, 0.5 for other pages

  Submit to Google Search Console after updating:
    https://search.google.com/search-console
-->
